# Orchestrator gate — classify → log → skill (or loud fallback)

After the profile gate, before answering substance or editing prototype
code, classify the ask against `harness/ORCHESTRATOR.md` §2.

- Matched → `Read` the full `SKILL.md` once per chat and follow it; never re-read a skill already read in this chat. More than one skill → §3 plan, wait for go.
- No match → §4 loud fallback. No substantive freestyle in the same turn.
- Log only `FALLBACK`, `MISROUTE`, `MISS`, or an approved plan to `harness/logs/routing-log.md`, plus the task's `log.md` row.
- Never edit `src/design-harness/**`, `projects/*/screens/**`, or prototype CSS without loading `ui-agent`.
- "Quick", "just", or "any thoughts?" never skip routing.

Full steps: `harness/references/classify-and-log.md`.
